   "text": "Arden University (Hybrid) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nArden University (Hybrid)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nAArden University is a British institution, with study centres in London, Birmingham, Leeda and Manchester, as well as Berlin in Germany. What makes this university particularly special is their commitment towards ensuring everyone has access to education regardless of tight schedules and daily commitments. Located in the start-up capital of Europe, Berlin, this university offers undergraduate and postgraduate courses in Germany, taught by highly-regarded professionals. Arden University encompasses thousands of international students in its degree programmes, which means that their academic expertise is available not only to locals but international students as well. Despite its wide range of degree programmes, Arden University also offers a flexible study timetable, with a combination of face-to-face and online study.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 06:31\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 06:31\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nGermany\nYearly Fees\nMax: €12,536.00\nMin: €8,380.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n500 of 5,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1990\nCampus(es)\nBerlin\nCountry\nGermany\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n03/08/2023\nContract End Date\n02/08/2029\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5MYwNI6l-LQ\nInternship Details\nInternship available\nAdditional Information\n-",
